  (text "J501 pin 20 = CHG_QON (ECO-002 / S4): UI-board power button to GND only (BQ /QON internal pull-up, no driven signal), ESD on the UI board; 1 s press exits ship mode, 10 s press = full system reset. Same-side FFC: main pin 20 ↔ UI pin 1."
    (at 63.5 228.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "68ba6524-1b6a-4ce0-abbb-ac86039e011e")
  )
